{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50857","headline":"省题诗二十一首 天骥呈才 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 天骥呈才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马知因圣出，才本自天生。\n驵骏何烦隐，权奇愿尽呈。\n电从双眼落，云向四蹄轻。\n过去王良喜，嘶来伯乐惊。\n绝尘惭逸步，曳练议能名。\n唯待金鞭下，春风紫陌情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}